    "markdown": "# Identical\n![](/images/identikeys.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white solid 5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nI touched on the `identical()` <u id='function_tooltip'>__function__</u> previously to compare two resulting <u id='data_frame_tooltip'>__data frames__</u>. \n`identical()` will compare two objects and if the objects are exactly identical it will print `TRUE`. \nIf they are not exactly identical it will print `FALSE`. \nThe <u id='function_tooltip'>function</u> can be given __scalars__, __vectors__, __data frames__ etc. \n\nTry out the below examples.\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nidentical(1,1)\nidentical(1,2)\nidentical(\"word\",\"word\")\nidentical(\"word\",\"orb\")\nidentical(1,\"1\")\nidentical(\"one\",1)\nidentical(1:5,1:5)\nidentical(1:5,6:9)\nidentical(1:5,1:6)\nidentical(c(\"a\",\"b\"),c(\"a\",\"b\"))\nidentical(c(\"a\",\"b\"),c(\"c\",\"b\"))\nidentical(c(\"a\",\"b\"),c(\"b\",\"a\"))\nidentical(english_df,english_df)\nidentical(english_df,tea_df)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-92e3105fccdc59052d92\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-92e3105fccdc59052d92\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-6800f853ad7e9c907d76\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-6800f853ad7e9c907d76\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7beb98d4a22f462f38db\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7beb98d4a22f462f38db\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3357dcc27543d84101dd\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3357dcc27543d84101dd\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-35edaff4df9bd598254f\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-35edaff4df9bd598254f\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7ddb2812d022ec50eaa0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7ddb2812d022ec50eaa0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-38b43a4ff671fe2bdfe7\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/j